# Generate 3D > Recommended models: each row shows what a generation costs and a line on its quality, a paid one a
# "Get a key" button; Tripo and Stability SPAR3D (direct, your key) are services of their own that stay off until a key is
# added; a free Space the update feed reports switched off (ui_space_health stands in for the feed here) says so, is greyed out in
# the Model list and Generate still runs the first Space that is up. Nothing is generated (no key, no network).
# CMake runs it at 1440x900 and 2880x1800 (the review sizes).
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic        # written for the Classic look
drop ../../assets/demo/teddy-sketch.png
wait_for "Generate 3D" 5
expect_text Recommended models
click "Generate 3D/Recommended models"
wait 0.2
expect_text Tripo v3.1
expect_text $0.20
expect_text Stability SPAR3D
expect_text $0.04
expect_text Get a key
shot generate-recommended
click "Generate 3D/Recommended models"   # closed again: the list is tall and pushes the service list down
wait 0.2

# The feed says the default free model is switched off and TRELLIS.2 is slow to start.
run ui_space_health spaces="hunyuan3d-2.1=off:Switched off by its author;trellis-2=slow:Asleep: the first run wakes it"
wait 0.2
click "Generate 3D/##service"
click "Hugging Face - free models"
wait 0.2
expect_text Switched off
expect_text Switched off by its author
shot generate-space-off
click "Generate 3D/Model"
expect_text May be slow to start
click "Hunyuan3D 2 mini Turbo (Tencent) - free, fastest"
wait 0.2
expect_text Hunyuan3D 2 mini Turbo (Tencent) - free, fastest

click "Generate 3D/##service"
expect_text Tripo (direct) - paid, your key
expect_text Stability SPAR3D (direct) - paid, your key
click "Tripo (direct) - paid, your key"
wait 0.2
expect_text Off until you add your own key from your Tripo account
expect_text Sends your image or description to Tripo (openapi.tripo3d.ai)
click "Generate 3D/Generate 3D model"
wait 0.5
expect_status Add your Tripo API key

click "Generate 3D/##service"
click "Stability SPAR3D (direct) - paid, your key"
wait 0.2
expect_text Off until you add your own key from your Stability AI account
click "Generate 3D/Generate 3D model"
wait 0.5
expect_status Add your Stability AI API key

